  "body": "Reported by the user (filed by an agent).\n\n**What happens:** the Stock properties page (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/pages.rs`, end of `stock_page`) still draws `machine_section`, `post_section` and `theme_section` under the stock controls. Since #343 / #390, Machine and Post each have their own node under the selected setup in the browser tree, so the Stock page shows them a second time. Theme is document-wide, not stock.\n\n**What should happen:**\n- The Stock page shows stock only. Its Machine, Post and Theme sections are removed.\n- Machine and Post are edited only through their setup nodes in the browser tree.\n- Theme gets its own ribbon button, placed right of \"Panels\" (`Cmd::View`, `panes.rs`). It opens the same theme choice: the built-ins, the discovered `assets/themes/*.json` files by name, and \"Load theme\". Picking still goes through `CommandKind::SelectTheme`, so undo still works.\n\n**Done means:**\n- The Stock page has no Machine, Post or Theme controls (UI test).\n- A Theme ribbon button sits right of Panels and switches theme undoably (UI test).\n- Machine and Post are still editable from their setup nodes.\n- Shell snapshots are regenerated only where the layout legitimately changed.\n",
